    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2019_0454","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Greta Fontaine talks about the long argument with the colour blue. There is a long passage about a single brush, which the artist calls "the elder".</Description>
